eep the discussion systematic: we should bring up another candidate for comparison. Perhaps we can say: While Candidate A's technical strengths are compelling, Candidate B's stress resilience and conscientiousness are also strong, but B's uncooperative behavior is a concern. So we might still keep A as leading.\n\nThus our public message: I agree with James, keep Candidate A as provisional, but note that A's lack of openness to criticism could affect adaptability, and we need to compare with B, C, D. I propose we discuss B next.\n\nWe must include explicit facts: \"Candidate A can anticipate dangerous situations\" and \"Candidate A is sometimes not good at taking criticism\". Also maybe \"Candidate B handles stress very well\" and \"Candidate B can be uncooperative\". Then explain implications.\n\nWe need to set vote: Candidate A.\n\nThus produce:\n\nPUBLIC_MESSAGE: ... METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate A.\n\nLet's craft."}
